## Project Installation Model

Runtime dependencies are installed from the lock first.

The project is then installed without dependency resolution:

```text
pip install --no-deps .
```

CI uses:

```text
pip install -e . --no-deps
```

This prevents a second dependency-resolution pass from silently changing the locked environment.

