## Continuous Deployment

The deploy workflow runs after successful CI on `main`.

Key properties:

- deploy only after successful push-based CI
- PR-triggered CI does not deploy
- checkout exact tested commit SHA
- build from the exact tested source
- tag images with the full Git SHA
- publish images to ECR
- register new ECS task-definition revisions
- update services without forcing a scale-up

